1
00:00:05,300 --> 00:00:09,451
In twenty twenty-six, I built a way back to the Moon.
2026 年，我做了这个游戏，想再回一次月球。

2
00:00:10,700 --> 00:00:13,849
I wanted somewhere quiet enough to see home.
我想找个安静的地方，回头看看家。

3
00:00:19,200 --> 00:00:22,839
Do not go gentle into that good night.
不要温顺地走进那个良夜。

4
00:00:30,800 --> 00:00:35,250
Rage, rage against the dying of the light.
怒吼吧，怒吼吧，抗拒那渐熄的光。

5
00:00:48,250 --> 00:00:52,207
Everyone I love lives on that fleck of blue.
我爱的人，都住在那一点蓝色里。

6
00:00:55,900 --> 00:00:58,835
Look down. Just one pair of boots.
低头看，只有一双靴子。

7
00:01:01,600 --> 00:01:04,962
It took thousands of hands to get them here.
把这双靴子送到这里的，是千千万万双手。

8
00:01:09,250 --> 00:01:10,798
Ready? Let go.
准备好了？松手。

9
00:01:17,200 --> 00:01:20,925
Once, the whole world leaned toward a little screen.
曾经，全世界的人都凑近了一方小小的荧屏。

10
00:01:24,800 --> 00:01:27,159
I came back for that feeling.
我想找回的，就是那种在一起的感觉。

11
00:01:31,700 --> 00:01:35,360
I still believe we can go farther together.
我依然相信，我们可以一起走得更远。

12
00:01:38,750 --> 00:01:42,283
Alone up here, I kept one eye on the needles.
独自留在舱里，我的目光总回到那些指针上。

13
00:01:47,200 --> 00:01:50,093
Columbia, this is Eagle. We have you in sight.
哥伦比亚号，这里是鹰号。我们看见你了。

14
00:01:57,250 --> 00:01:58,585
Hard dock.
对接锁定。

15
00:01:59,050 --> 00:02:01,260
Welcome back aboard.
欢迎归舱。

16
00:02:06,350 --> 00:02:10,075
From our blue Earth, we sail into eternity.
以蓝色出发，驶向永恒。
